1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:09,000
Save anything reusable in under 5 seconds: title, content, tags.

2
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:16,000
Text, links, images, files - one inbox, no folders.

3
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:28,000
Free plan holds 15 snippets. Pinned snippets float to the top.

4
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:37,000
Live search filters titles, content and tags as you type.

5
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:58,000
Open, copy, haptic confirmation - two taps to paste anywhere.

6
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:10,000
At 15 snippets the free plan ends. SnipStack Pro removes the limit, powered by the RevenueCat SDK.

7
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:22,000
Settings: entitlement state and restore purchases, all driven by RevenueCat.

8
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:35,000
SnipStack - open source under MIT, built by a student for Shipaton 2026.
